      "headline": "Canada announces 'dollar-for-dollar' retaliatory tariffs on US as high as 50%",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "Canada announces 'dollar-for-dollar' retaliatory tariffs on US as high as 50% - Published Canada has announced counter-tariffs as high as 50% on a range of US goods in retaliation to the latest wave of levies on Canadian imports imposed by President Donald Trump last weekend.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-26T08:05:27.618696+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "e90717ac1718f0a83d07e955d9f4e5f18c0efe7568151ffd8534cc114bf3c691",
          "excerpt": "Canada announces 'dollar-for-dollar' retaliatory tariffs on US as high as 50% - Published Canada has announced counter-tariffs as high as 50% on a range of US goods in retaliation to the latest wave of levies on Canadian imports imposed by President Donald Trump last weekend.",
          "sentence_hash": "f57c241acb9c59f868a6cfd779af6a9d63a4f73530bc149c4acffea136a8d3e5",
          "anchors": [
            "50%"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "The Canadian tariffs will apply to nearly C$28bn ($20bn; Â£15bn) worth of American products, ranging from steel to furniture, fresh tuna and cotton T-shirts, officials announced on Tuesday.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-26T08:05:27.618744+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "e90717ac1718f0a83d07e955d9f4e5f18c0efe7568151ffd8534cc114bf3c691",
          "excerpt": "The Canadian tariffs will apply to nearly C$28bn ($20bn; Â£15bn) worth of American products, ranging from steel to furniture, fresh tuna and cotton T-shirts, officials announced on Tuesday.",
          "sentence_hash": "c2a970a1d87c804eac7237f53589ce495bdf5ef2bc8135fac133421a1e7ecb49",
          "anchors": [
            "$20",
            "$28"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "It is the latest escalation after US-Canada trade talks collapsed late last week, with each side accusing the other of making last-minute demands that were unreasonable.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-26T08:05:27.618786+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "e90717ac1718f0a83d07e955d9f4e5f18c0efe7568151ffd8534cc114bf3c691",
          "excerpt": "It is the latest escalation after US-Canada trade talks collapsed late last week, with each side accusing the other of making last-minute demands that were unreasonable.",
          "sentence_hash": "20ab0c67f11baf8482d1e619375926ef522f8aedbaf7e015d2c7083531f47caf",
          "anchors": [
            "us"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "Finance Minister FranÃ§ois-Philippe Champagne said that Canada's retaliation is in response to 50% tariffs imposed by the Trump administration on a range of Canadian goods after trade talks fell apart on Friday.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-26T08:05:27.618821+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "e90717ac1718f0a83d07e955d9f4e5f18c0efe7568151ffd8534cc114bf3c691",
          "excerpt": "Finance Minister FranÃ§ois-Philippe Champagne said that Canada's retaliation is in response to 50% tariffs imposed by the Trump administration on a range of Canadian goods after trade talks fell apart on Friday.",
          "sentence_hash": "446257e58f32b5b645a8854f43f59074a27de8df9149193e1c66174228c59a10",
          "anchors": [
            "50%"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "\"Those tariffs will have real consequences for Canadian workers, businesses and communities across our nation,\" he said.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-26T08:05:27.618871+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "e90717ac1718f0a83d07e955d9f4e5f18c0efe7568151ffd8534cc114bf3c691",
          "excerpt": "\"Those tariffs will have real consequences for Canadian workers, businesses and communities across our nation,\" he said.",
          "sentence_hash": "a9b9c8ce19e1f09358737c879733bd06354bf219eb7dc30431f1b603036137e1",
          "anchors": [
            "us",
            "businesses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "\"Canada must respond.\" Champagne characterised Canada's retaliation as \"proportionate\" and \"strategic\".",
